      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whatever the sync status, everything you have recorded is saved on this device and you can keep adding and editing. It is sent automatically once you are back online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不論同步狀態如何，已經記錄的帳務都保存在這台裝置上，可以繼續新增與編輯；恢復連線後會自動補送。"
